            "review_title": "Review at Xoài Đu",
            "review_text": "isabella b\n12 contributions\n0\nBest Banh Xeo in Hanoi 👏🥳\nMay 2025 • Couples\nWe ate at Xoai Du a number of times during our time in Hanoi and it is home to my favourite dish of my trip - Banh Xeo!! The Banh Xeo here is SO GOOD 😋👏 As is everything else we tried from the menu! My other favourite is the Bun Cha! But honestly everything here is good! Including the fresh juices and the best Kombucha we've ever had!\nThe staff here are lovely and a special thanks to the lovely owner who took the time to say hello to us each time we came and made special adjustments for gluten free and adding no MSG to meals. Set in a peaceful garden this is a must visit in Hanoi!!\nWe already look forward to the next time we can come back 🤗\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 20, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
