            "review_text": "Dipesh Patel D\n2 contributions\n0\nI recommend Bun Bo and Bun Bo Nam Bo\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nEverything inside is neat and clean, what makes experience even more enjoyable.\nCozy and lovely place to come for a bite to eat (and a drink if you want as well!). Tucked away and quiet spot near the lake. Loads of vegetarian and vegan options of both traditional Vietnamese and other fusion style dishes. Tried my first vegan Bun Bo, huge portion for a good price and really tasty!\nStaff are so fast with the service, and this place is popular with both locals and tourists.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 26, 2024",
