            "review_text": "catherina f\n2 contributions\n0\na hidden gem\nDec 2023 • Family\nWe had the pleasure of dining at Xoai Du Bistro during our recent stay at the InterContinental Hanoi Westlake. Their beef noodle soup was absolutely delightful, packed with fresh vegetables and a delightful nutty crunch from the peanuts. It's the perfect spot to unwind and enjoy a comforting, home-cooked meal.\nAnd for those with vegan preferences, they have a variety of plant-based options available. If you're looking for something a bit more interactive, they host chess gatherings every Sunday and even offer wine and coffee appreciation workshops.Xoai Du Bistro is truly a hidden gem worth seeking out.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 5, 2023",
