            "review_text": "Mai T\nHanoi, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nVietnamese Cafe Workshop\nApr 2023 • Business\nExcellent coffee from Vietnam! Yum yum!\nI had a chance to join the Coffee Workshop which was organized on Saturday morning of April. I attended as the translator for the whole workshop. It was amazing information about many types of coffee as well as how to make Vietnamese coffee with different ways : filter, pour, and the espresso from the coffee machine! It turned out so much experiences to explore the aromatic and taste of coffee.\nThat's great experience highly recommend to everyone! 35$ person you have full coffee set + gift and very professional guiding from coffee expert and fully coffee delicious tasting coffee! Amazing! Check out them all on google, facebook... you will see rate 5* review!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 30, 2023",
